.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt GENERAL_NAME 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm GENERAL_NAME ,
.Nm GENERAL_NAME_set1_X509_NAME
.Nd GENERAL_NAME method routines
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509v3.h
.Ft typedef struct GENERAL_NAME_st GENERAL_NAME;

 int
.Fo GENERAL_NAME_set1_X509_NAME
.Fa "GENERAL_NAME **tgt"
.Fa "const X509_NAME *src"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn GENERAL_NAME_set1_X509_NAME
creates a new GENERAL_NAME of type GEN_DIRNAME and populates it based on
provided X509_NAME
.Fa src
which can be NULL.
.Fa tgt
must not be NULL. If successful,
.Em *tgt
will be set to point to the newly created GENERAL_NAME.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn GENERAL_NAME_set1_X509_NAME
return 1 on success, 0 on error.
.Sh HISTORY
.Fn GENERAL_NAME_set1_X509_NAME
was added in OpenSSL 3.4.
